cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use verifa11y or its benchmark in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "verifa11y"
abstract: >-
  An open-source HTML accessibility checker that writes a patch for each WCAG violation it finds, applies it to a copy
  of the page, re-checks it in a real browser with axe-core, the accessibility tree, focus order and pixel
  comparison, and keeps only the patches that hold.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "mateogsilvaa and the verifa11y contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mateogsilvaa/verifa11y"
url: "https://mateogsilvaa.github.io/verifa11y/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-11-20
keywords:
  - accessibility
  - WCAG
  - axe-core
  - HTML
  - automated remediation
  - Model Context Protocol
